From b8f804a117f7f3cfed6acea3f489bc28e8c2a871 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 15:36:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] testsuites/dl06: Link the base image with LIBDL_TESTS_LDFLAGS

dl06 failed with

  dlopen failed: global symbol not found: _tls_rand48_add

dl06-o2.c calls lcong48(), so the loaded module needs newlib's rand48
thread-local state.  Nothing in the base image references it, so the
archive member is never pulled in, the symbol never reaches the global
symbol table rtems-syms generates, and the module cannot be resolved.

dl06.yml carried an empty ldflags list where dl07, dl08 and dl09 all pass
${LIBDL_TESTS_LDFLAGS}, so the mechanism for forcing such symbols in was
simply never wired up for this test.  Wire it up, and add the three rand48
thread-local symbols to the list.

This fails identically under GCC, so it is not compiler specific.

dl06 still fails, now for an unrelated reason further along: rtems-ld
produces a .rap the loader rejects with "offset past end of file", and
rtems-rap cannot read it either, reporting "compression: Reading of value
failed".  That reproduces with the stock RSB-built rtems-ld, so it is a
pre-existing bug this fix merely uncovers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 spec/build/testsuites/libtests/dl06.yml         | 3 ++-
 spec/build/testsuites/libtests/optdlldflags.yml | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/dl06.yml b/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/dl06.yml
index 59c738c33e..88255d095e 100644
--- a/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/dl06.yml
+++ b/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/dl06.yml
@@ -39,7 +39,8 @@ enabled-by:
   - BUILD_LIBDL
 includes:
 - testsuites/libtests/dl06
-ldflags: []
+ldflags:
+- ${LIBDL_TESTS_LDFLAGS}
 links: []
 prepare-build: null
 prepare-configure: null
diff --git a/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/optdlldflags.yml b/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/optdlldflags.yml
index 0c94332f6d..e935e999fe 100644
--- a/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/optdlldflags.yml
+++ b/spec/build/testsuites/libtests/optdlldflags.yml
@@ -15,6 +15,9 @@ default:
   - -u__muldf3
   - -u__eqdf2
   - -u__fixdfsi
+  - -u_tls_rand48_add
+  - -u_tls_rand48_mult
+  - -u_tls_rand48_seed
 - enabled-by: true
   value: []
 description: |
